 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "If you've applied to *thousands* of jobs",
   "start": 0.04,
   "times": [
    0.04,
    0.28,
    0.64,
    1.07,
    1.19,
    1.64,
    1.73
   ],
   "end": 2.13
  },
  {
   "text": "and *nobody* is calling you back,",
   "start": 2.15,
   "times": [
    2.15,
    2.93,
    3.28,
    3.4,
    3.68,
    3.8
   ],
   "end": 4.41
  },
  {
   "text": "it's not the *job market.*",
   "start": 4.43,
   "times": [
    4.43,
    4.68,
    4.91,
    5.01,
    5.24
   ],
   "end": 5.9
  },
  {
   "text": "It's your *resume.*",
   "start": 5.92,
   "times": [
    5.92,
    6.25,
    6.54
   ],
   "end": 7.39
  },
  {
   "text": "So, fix *number 1:*",
   "start": 7.41,
   "times": [
    7.41,
    7.63,
    7.99,
    8.31
   ],
   "end": 9.07
  },
  {
   "text": "use the *right words.*",
   "start": 9.09,
   "times": [
    9.09,
    9.43,
    9.52,
    9.94
   ],
   "end": 11.2
  },
  {
   "text": "To do that,",
   "start": 11.22,
   "times": [
    11.22,
    11.31,
    11.51
   ],
   "end": 12.3
  },
  {
   "text": "pick out the *skills* they ask for.",
   "start": 12.32,
   "times": [
    12.32,
    12.54,
    12.72,
    12.81,
    12.9,
    13.0,
    13.1
   ],
   "end": 13.62
  },
  {
   "text": "If the job says *\"data analysis\"*",
   "start": 13.64,
   "times": [
    13.64,
    14.26,
    14.38,
    14.51,
    14.63,
    14.86
   ],
   "end": 15.63
  },
  {
   "text": "and your resume says",
   "start": 15.65,
   "times": [
    15.65,
    16.11,
    16.3,
    17.45
   ],
   "end": 18.96
  },
  {
   "text": "*\"good with numbers,\"*",
   "start": 18.98,
   "times": [
    18.98,
    19.16,
    19.33
   ],
   "end": 20.38
  },
  {
   "text": "your resume gets *rejected.*",
   "start": 20.4,
   "times": [
    20.4,
    20.59,
    20.84,
    21.09
   ],
   "end": 22.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix *number 2:*",
   "start": 22.14,
   "times": [
    22.14,
    22.44,
    22.69
   ],
   "end": 23.42
  },
  {
   "text": "*add numbers.*",
   "start": 23.44,
   "times": [
    23.44,
    23.7
   ],
   "end": 24.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Don't just say what you did.",
   "start": 24.62,
   "times": [
    24.62,
    25.02,
    25.31,
    25.49,
    25.81,
    25.93
   ],
   "end": 26.86
  },
  {
   "text": "Add the *numbers*",
   "start": 26.88,
   "times": [
    26.88,
    27.05,
    27.11
   ],
   "end": 27.42
  },
  {
   "text": "for what you *changed*",
   "start": 27.44,
   "times": [
    27.44,
    27.56,
    27.75,
    28.16
   ],
   "end": 28.69
  },
  {
   "text": "because of you.",
   "start": 28.71,
   "times": [
    28.71,
    29.19,
    29.38
   ],
   "end": 30.31
  },
  {
   "text": "Recruiters will *stop scrolling*",
   "start": 30.33,
   "times": [
    30.33,
    30.88,
    31.44,
    31.88
   ],
   "end": 32.79
  },
  {
   "text": "when you add this.",
   "start": 32.81,
   "times": [
    32.81,
    32.93,
    33.06,
    33.36
   ],
   "end": 33.85
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix 3: skip the *fancy template.*",
   "start": 33.87,
   "times": [
    33.87,
    34.02,
    34.31,
    35.0,
    35.2,
    35.75
   ],
   "end": 36.57,
   "style": {
    "y": 1150
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Icons, tables and *2 columns*",
   "start": 36.59,
   "times": [
    36.59,
    37.06,
    37.86,
    38.07,
    38.29
   ],
   "end": 38.63,
   "style": {
    "y": 1150
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "*confuse* recruiters.",
   "start": 38.65,
   "times": [
    38.65,
    39.49
   ],
   "end": 40.01,
   "style": {
    "y": 1150
   }
  },
  {
